 788:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** /** @defgroup SPI_Group2 Data transfers functions
 789:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****  *  @brief   Data transfers functions
 790:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****  *
 791:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** @verbatim   
 792:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****  ===============================================================================
 793:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****                       ##### Data transfers functions #####
 794:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 795:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** 
 796:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****  [..] This section provides a set of functions allowing to manage the SPI data 
 797:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****       transfers. In reception, data are received and then stored into an internal 
 798:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****       Rx buffer while. In transmission, data are first stored into an internal Tx 
 799:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****       buffer before being transmitted.
 800:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** 
 801:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****  [..] The read access of the SPI_DR register can be done using the SPI_I2S_ReceiveData()
 802:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****       function and returns the Rx buffered value. Whereas a write access to the SPI_DR 
 803:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****       can be done using SPI_I2S_SendData() function and stores the written data into 
 804:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****       Tx buffer.
 805:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** 
 806:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** @endverbatim
 807:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****   * @{
 808:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c ****   */
 809:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_spi.c **** 
